# AI & LLM Rules

- **API Keys:** NEVER use API keys for LLMs. All inference MUST be on-device or locally integrated.
- **Model Storage:** Store `.tflite` models in `app/src/main/assets/`.
- **Inference:** Ensure long-running inference (like speech-to-intent) does not block the UI thread.
- **Voice Recognition:** Implement robust debouncing and cancellation logic for voice command sessions.
